'''Maros''' (Marosan:ᨆᨑᨚᨔᨛ, Maros), officially the '''Special Territory of Maros''' (Marosan:ᨓᨗᨒᨐ ᨀᨘᨔᨘᨔᨛᨊ ᨆᨑᨚᨔᨛ, Wilaya Kususna Maros), is the capital and largest city of [[Pangkajene]]